# Contact form email delivery (https://web3forms.com — free, no backend needed)
#
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com and enter abhimsound@gmail.com
# 2. You'll instantly get an Access Key emailed to you — no signup/password required
# 3. Set it below (local dev) and/or as a Vercel Environment Variable named
#    VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY (Project Settings -> Environment Variables) for production
#
# Until this is set, the contact form falls back to opening a pre-filled
# mailto: link, so it still works either way.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
